Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxIiwicm9sZSI6IlVTRVIiLCJpYXQiOjE3ODYwODU3ODUsImV4cCI6MTc4NjA4NzU4NX0.egh2o1iXVxLO53WACnsehoCgYNf6JQqdKG19GKeJMwQ2ffuSRpIOWUT45gOa3Jc4

{
  "title": "테스트 콘서트",
  "venue": "잠실 실내체육관",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-25T19:00:00",
  "bookingOpenAt": "2026-08-10T10:00:00"
}

### 공연 조회 (토큰 불필요)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events/1

### 공연 목록 (토큰 불필요)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/events

### 테스트용 - 예매 이미 열린 공연 등록
POST http://localhost:8080/api/events
Content-Type: application/json
